	(text_box "The bat floats under the perch (or swings on its thread over the\npendulum coils). L301: 10 turns on each of 4 layers, 0.2 mm\ntrack and gap, round the magnet (r 7 to 11 mm), 36 uH; with C301\n(100 nF C0G) it resonates at 84 kHz, where the levitation bridge\nadds its carrier. The two eyes (side-view orange LEDs at the\nhead's edge) light on alternate half-cycles: about 4 mA each at\n0.4 A of carrier, 7 mA at 0.5 A (sim/physics/bat_power.py). No\nbattery, no wires: the magnet in the printed cap holds it up,\nthe field lights it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.7800 116.8400 0) (size 59.6900 17.7800)
